{"2930030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oath of the Necromancer", "steam_appid": 2930030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3739cbac324cbe91afe4c7ecc0b08da4.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1560 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Oath of the Necromancer</strong> is a summoning-based rogue-like rooted in Greek-Egyptian myth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raise the dead, grow an army and conquer all that stands in your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raid, pillage and raise more to join your cause - the destruction of the old tyrant's forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do so in the name of Serapis - a once powerful God now in need of help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1048 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Amass a worthy army, up to the <strong>thousands</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raise powerful warriors, mages, archers, beasts and monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cover your armies weaknesses by strategically shaping your army. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every playthrough let's you try new combinations and variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built for replayability, each run will let you make many strategic choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will it be enough to bring down the tyrant's forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find new synergies every time you set foot in the tyrant's realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Recover powerful relics that grant game-changing upgrades, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">improve your necromancy, enhance your summons, or become a destructive battle-mage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return with your spoils of war to grow permanently stronger and improve your chances of slaying the old tyrant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your people need a place to settle. Rebuild Serapis' temple, expand it,  and find yourself with more allies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help your townsfolk, mingle, and watch your community grow over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The old tyrant left many to wander the deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Word gets around - remarkable allies may move in and aid in your cause. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find the remains of ancient heroes and bring them back to life, some of which you may remember. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find out how the heroes take their newly granted second chances, and of how much help they can be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps... you can change their fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you streaming on <strong>Twitch</strong> and want to involve your chat? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or do you like to screen-share to your friends via <strong>Discord</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your chat and friends can join your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Connect your Twitch account and they can join by typing !join in Twitch chat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOTE: You can be <strong>offline</strong>! <i>Live Twitch stream is not needed for this to work.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOTE2: Interactive mechanics are planned, stay tuned for those!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is still in demo and major changes will still happen, many inspired by - <strong>YOU</strong> - the players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/d2d20c81e199c5c1aab990ed475d7f6d.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">... to know that we <strong>care</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Let us know what you think and what you would like to see. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We listen to players and always love chatting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join our community on <strong>Discord</strong>!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3739cbac324cbe91afe4c7ecc0b08da4.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1560 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Oath of the Necromancer</strong> is a summoning-based rogue-like rooted in Greek-Egyptian myth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raise the dead, grow an army and conquer all that stands in your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raid, pillage and raise more to join your cause - the destruction of the old tyrant's forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do so in the name of Serapis - a once powerful God now in need of help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1048 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Amass a worthy army, up to the <strong>thousands</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raise powerful warriors, mages, archers, beasts and monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cover your armies weaknesses by strategically shaping your army. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every playthrough let's you try new combinations and variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built for replayability, each run will let you make many strategic choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will it be enough to bring down the tyrant's forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find new synergies every time you set foot in the tyrant's realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Recover powerful relics that grant game-changing upgrades, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">improve your necromancy, enhance your summons, or become a destructive battle-mage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return with your spoils of war to grow permanently stronger and improve your chances of slaying the old tyrant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your people need a place to settle. Rebuild Serapis' temple, expand it,  and find yourself with more allies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help your townsfolk, mingle, and watch your community grow over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The old tyrant left many to wander the deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Word gets around - remarkable allies may move in and aid in your cause. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find the remains of ancient heroes and bring them back to life, some of which you may remember. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find out how the heroes take their newly granted second chances, and of how much help they can be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps... you can change their fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you streaming on <strong>Twitch</strong> and want to involve your chat? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or do you like to screen-share to your friends via <strong>Discord</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your chat and friends can join your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Connect your Twitch account and they can join by typing !join in Twitch chat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOTE: You can be <strong>offline</strong>! <i>Live Twitch stream is not needed for this to work.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOTE2: Interactive mechanics are planned, stay tuned for those!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is still in demo and major changes will still happen, many inspired by - <strong>YOU</strong> - the players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/d2d20c81e199c5c1aab990ed475d7f6d.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">... to know that we <strong>care</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Let us know what you think and what you would like to see. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We listen to players and always love chatting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join our community on <strong>Discord</strong>!</p>", "short_description": "Raise the bones of the fallen and create an army of the undead - warriors, archers, mages, monsters &amp; beasts. Take revenge 